@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Quản trị viên" as Admin
participant "Web Admin" as Web
participant "DashboardController" as Controller
participant "StatisticsService" as Service
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Admin -> Web: Truy cập màn hình Dashboard
activate Web

Web -> Controller: GET /api/admin/dashboard/stats
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: getDashboardStatistics()
activate Service

par Lấy dữ liệu song song
    Service -> DB: COUNT(users) WHERE created_at = TODAY
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Số lượng User mới
    deactivate DB
    
    Service -> DB: SUM(amount) FROM transactions WHERE status='SUCCESS'
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Tổng doanh thu
    deactivate DB
    
    Service -> DB: SUM(view_count) FROM comics
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Tổng số lượt xem
    deactivate DB
end

Service --> Controller: DashboardStatsDTO
deactivate Service

Controller --> Web: 200 OK (JSON Data)
deactivate Controller

Web -> Web: Parse JSON và Render Biểu đồ (ChartJS/Recharts)
Web --> Admin: Hiển thị các Biểu đồ thống kê trực quan
deactivate Web
@enduml
